msgstr "Measures the journal against Scopus, Web of Science and DOAJ criteria using OJS data and OpenAlex, supports evidence-based manual assessment, and produces an action plan and a printable dossier for indexing applications. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah for Research and Studies."

